  "translation": "Long wanem, taim ol yu tanim bek long Yahwe, ol brata bilong yu na ol pikinini bilong yu bai kisim marimari long ai bilong ol man i holim ol long kalabus, na bai ol i kamap bek long graun dispela; long wanem, Yahwe Elohim bilong yu em i man i gat strongpela marimari, na i no ken kirapim pes bilong em long yu, sapos yu tanim bek long em.",
